{"version":1,"id":"hamilton-an-american-musical-my-shot","title":"My Shot","artist":"Hamilton: An American Musical","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/hamilton/my-shot/?instrument=keyboard","spotifyUrl":"https://open.spotify.com/track/7kuBbIonjbECcduYB9LrSB","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Lin-Manuel Miranda","chords":[{"symbol":"Gm","canonical":"Gm","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,10,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bb","canonical":"Bb","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bdim","canonical":"Bdim7","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,5,8],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Bdim7"},{"symbol":"Cm","canonical":"Cm","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,3,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Dm","canonical":"Dm","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,5,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#","canonical":"D#","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G5","canonical":"G5","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot","columns":35,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":33,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Hey yo, I'm just like my country","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm young, scrappy, and hungry","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm not throwing away my shot","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"instrumental","text":"(   )","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I'mma get scholarship to King's College","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I probably shouldn't brag, but dag, I amaze and astonish","columns":56,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bb","column":32,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"The problem is I got a lot of brains, but no polish","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Cm","column":23,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I gotta holler just to be heard","columns":31,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":27,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"With every word I drop knowledge","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm a diamond in the rough, a shiny piece of coal","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Tryin' to reach my goal, my power of speech: unimpeachable","columns":67,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":10,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":56,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Cm","column":65,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Only nineteen, but my mind is older","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"These New York City streets getting colder, I shoulder","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Ev'ry burden, ev'ry disadvantage","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I have learned to manage. I don't have a gun to brandish","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"                       N/A","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I walk these streets famished","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"The plan is to fan this spark into a flame","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":24,"beat":1}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"But damn, it's getting dark, so let me spell out my name","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"I am the-","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"A-L, E-X, A-N, D","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":15,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"E-R-we are-meant to be","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"A colony that runs independently","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":30,"beat":1}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Meanwhile, Britain keeps shitting on us endlessly","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Essentially, they tax us relentlessly","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Then King George turns around, runs a spending spree","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":10,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"He ain't never gonna set his descendants free","columns":45,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":9,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Dm","column":29,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"So there will be a revolution in this century","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"N/A","columns":3,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"ENTER ME!","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"(He says in parentheses)","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Don't be shocked when your history book mentions me","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":9,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"I will lay down my life if it sets us free","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":7,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Dm","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Eventually you'll see my ascendancy","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"And I am not throwing away my shot (my shot)","columns":44,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":39,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot (my shot)","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Hey yo, I'm just like my country","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm young, scrappy, and hungry","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm not throwing away my shot","columns":33,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":30,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot","columns":32,"beats":3,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":26,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Am","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"Hey yo, I'm just like my country","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm young, scrappy, and hungry","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm not throwing away my shot","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"It's time to take a shot!","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"I dream of life without the monarchy","columns":38,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":33,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":36,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"The unrest in France will lead to \"onarchy\"","columns":46,"beats":7,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":38,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"\"Onarchy?\" How you say, how you s-Oh, anarchy!","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":38,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Dm","column":42,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":46,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"When I fight I make the other side panicky","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":35,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":"With my","columns":7,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-53","kind":"lyric","text":"Shot!","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-54","kind":"lyric","text":"Yo, I'm a tailor's apprentice","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-55","kind":"lyric","text":"And I got y'all knuckleheads in loco parentis","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-56","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm joining the rebellion cuz I know it's my chance","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-57","kind":"lyric","text":"To socially advance, instead of sewin' some pants","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-58","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm gonna take a","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-59","kind":"lyric","text":"HAMILTON, MULLIGAN, LAURENS, LAFAYETTE:","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-60","kind":"lyric","text":"Shot!","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-61","kind":"lyric","text":"Eh, but we'll never be truly free","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-62","kind":"lyric","text":"Until those in bondage have the same rights as you and me","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":56,"beat