 look hot","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-75","kind":"lyric","text":"Laurens, I like you a lot","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-76","kind":"lyric","text":"Let's hatch a plot blacker than the kettle callin' the pot","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-77","kind":"lyric","text":"What are the odds the gods would put us all in one spot","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":56,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-78","kind":"lyric","text":"Poppin' a squat on conventional wisdom, like it or not","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-79","kind":"lyric","text":"A bunch of revolutionary manumission abolitionists","columns":50,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Dm","column":30,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#","column":40,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-80","kind":"lyric","text":"N/A","columns":3,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-81","kind":"lyric","text":"Give me a position, show me where the ammunition is","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-82","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, am I talkin' too loud?","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-83","kind":"lyric","text":"Sometimes I get over excited, shoot off at the mouth","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-84","kind":"lyric","text":"I never had a group of friends before","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-85","kind":"lyric","text":"I promise that I'll make y'all proud","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-86","kind":"lyric","text":"Let's get this guy in front of a crowd!","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-87","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwing away my shot","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":5,"