ooh!!","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-102","kind":"lyric","text":"Wo-oh-oh (Wo-oh-oh)","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-103","kind":"lyric","text":"Sing let 'em hear ya (Yeah)","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-104","kind":"lyric","text":"Let's go! (Woah-woah, wo-oh-oh)","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":29,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Bb","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-105","kind":"lyric","text":"I said, shout it to the rooftops","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-106","kind":"lyric","text":"(Wo-oh-oh)","columns":11,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":9,"beat":1}]},{"id":"line-107","kind":"lyric","text":"Said to the rooftops","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-108","kind":"lyric","text":"(Wo-oh-oh)","columns":10,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-109","kind":"lyric","text":"Now come on","columns":11,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-110","kind":"lyric","text":"(Yeah)","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-111","kind":"lyric","text":"Now come on, let's go","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-112","kind":"lyric","text":"Rise up","columns":7,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-113","kind":"lyric","text":"When you're living on your knees, you rise up","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":33,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-114","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell your brother that he's got to rise up","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":28,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-115","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell your sister that she's got to rise up","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":28,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-116","kind":"lyric","text":"When are these colonies gonna rise up","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-117","kind":"lyric","text":"(Whoa, woah)","columns":12,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-118","kind":"lyric","text":"When are these colonies gonna rise up (Woah)","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-119","kind":"lyric","text":"When are these colonies gonna rise up (Woah)","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-120","kind":"lyric","text":"When are these colonies gonna rise up (Woah)","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-121","kind":"lyric","text":"Rise up","columns":7,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-122","kind":"lyric","text":"I imagine death so much it feels more like a memory","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-123","kind":"lyric","text":"When's it's gonna get me?","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-124","kind":"lyric","text":"In my sleep? Seven feet ahead of me?","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-125","kind":"lyric","text":"If I see it coming, do I run or do I let it be?","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-126","kind":"lyric","text":"Is it like a beat without a melody?","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-127","kind":"lyric","text":"See, I never thought I'd live past twenty","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-128","kind":"lyric","text":"Where I come from some get half as many","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-129","kind":"lyric","text":"Ask anybody why we livin' fast and we laugh, reach for a flask","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-130","kind":"lyric","text":"We have to make this moment last, that's plenty","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-131","kind":"lyric","text":"Scratch that","columns":12,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-132","kind":"lyric","text":"This is not a moment, it's the movement","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":36,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-133","kind":"lyric","text":"Where all the hungriest brothers with something to prove went","columns":61,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":51,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-134","kind":"lyric","text":"Foes oppose us, we take an honest stand","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-135","kind":"lyric","text":"We roll like Moses, claimin' our Promised Land","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-136","kind":"lyric","text":"And? If we win our independence?","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-137","kind":"lyric","text":"'Zat a guarantee of freedom for our descendants?","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-138","kind":"lyric","text":"Or will the blood we shed begin an endless","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-139","kind":"lyric","text":"Cycle of vengeance and death with no defendants?","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-140","kind":"lyric","text":"I know the action in the street is excitin'","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-141","kind":"lyric","text":"But Jesus, between all the bleedin' 'n fightin'","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-142","kind":"lyric","text":"I've been readin' 'n writin'","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-143","kind":"lyric","text":"We need to handle our financial situation","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":38,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-144","kind":"lyric","text":"Are we a nation of states? What's the state of our nation?","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-145","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm past patiently waitin'! I'm passionately smashin' every expectation","columns":71,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":33,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":46,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bb","column":55,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-146","kind":"lyric","text":"Every action's an act of creation","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bdim","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-147","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm laughin' in the face of casualties and sorrow","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-148","kind":"lyric","text":"For the first time, I'm thinkin' past tomorrow","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-149","kind":"lyric","text":"And I am not throwin' away my shot","columns":36,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":34,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-150","kind":"lyric","text":"I am not throwin' away my shot","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-151","kind":"lyric","text":"Hey, yo, I'm just like my country","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":13,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-152","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm young, scrappy, and hungry","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-153","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm not throwin' away my shot","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-154","kind":"lyric","text":"We gonna","columns":8,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-155","kind":"lyric","text":"rise up; time to take a shot","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-156","kind":"lyric","text":"(Not thrown' away my shot)","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-157","kind":"lyric","text":"We gonna","columns":8,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-158","kind":"lyric","text":"rise up; time to take a shot","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bb","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-159","kind":"lyric","text":"(Not throwin' away my shot)","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-160","kind":"lyric","text":"We gonna","columns":8,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bdim","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-161","kind":"lyric","text":"(rise up, rise up)","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-162","kind":"lyric","text":"It's time to take a shot","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-163","kind":"lyric","text":"(Rise up, rise up)","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-164","kind":"lyric","text":"It's time to take a shot (rise up, rise up)","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-165","kind":"lyric","text":"(Wo-oah) Time to take a shot (rise up)","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-166","kind":"lyric","text":"Take a shot, a shot, a shot, (Oh-Oh, oh)","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-167","kind":"lyric","text":"A-yo, it's time to take a shot (Woah, oh-oh oh)","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-168","kind":"lyric","text":"Time to take a shot (Woah-oh)","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-169","kind":"lyric","text":"And I am (And I am)","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-170","kind":"lyric","text":"N/A","columns":3,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-171","kind":"lyric","text":"Not throwing away my","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-172","kind":"lyric","text":"Not throwing away my shot!","columns":34,"beats":14,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D","column":13,"beat":6},{"symbol":"D","column":17,"beat":8},{"symbol":"G5","column":32,"beat":10}]}]}